  "title": "Introduce TLS MITM Detection on Tor Project websites",
  "description": "This ticket is to implement the feature of TLS MITM detection on Tor Project websites in the same way caddy webserver is doing it https://caddyserver.com/docs/mitm-detection on the basis of this paper https://jhalderm.com/pub/papers/interception-ndss17.pdf .\n\nCollecting data on who's maybe trying to attempt to MITM Tor Project website access can be a valuable adversarial intelligence resource",
